  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">S4-78 Tugende entrepen&#xf6;rst&#xf6;d</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">S4-78 Tugende entrepreneurial support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tugende is a for-profit social enterprise in Kampla. They purchases   motorcyles and uses an innovative and though screening process to     identfy reliable recipients. They offer a rent-to-own option,         providing a loan in the form of a new motorcycle to be paid off in 18 months, with weekly payment.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Tugende &#xe4;r ett vinstdrivande &quot;socialt&quot; f&#xf6;retag i Kampla. De k&#xf6;per     motorcyklar och erbjuder sedan specillt utsedda f&#xf6;rare att ing&#xe5; i ett hyra/k&#xf6;peavtal De erbjuder f&#xf6;rarna att hyra motorcykel med en         avbetalningsplan p&#xe5; 18 m&#xe5;nader. Efter 18 m&#xe5;nader &#xe4;ger f&#xf6;raren         motorcykeln. L&#xe5;net betalas av veckovis.</narrative>
  </description>
